# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
android/
*.translation
export_presets.cfg
.import/

# Build output
builds/
LatestBuild/
## The export dialog defaults to the project root rather than builds/, so the
## binaries land here unless someone remembers to redirect them. Mayhem.exe is
## 214MB - past what GitHub accepts for a single file - and it is regenerated
## from source every time, so it is never worth versioning.
/Mayhem.exe
/Mayhem.console.exe
/*.pck

# OS / editor noise
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
## Obsidian's per-user workspace state, created when the docs vault is opened.
.obsidian/
## godotTools.editorPath is an absolute path to whichever Godot build that
## particular machine has installed, so this is per-user by nature.
.vscode/

## Backup que Blender escribe solo al guardar, al lado del .blend. Se regenera
## en cada guardado y versionarlo duplica el peso del asset sin agregar nada.
*.blend1
